                            <comment id="468606" author="rread" created="Fri, 22 Aug 2025 12:20:15 +0000">&lt;p&gt;Would these functions work on any client, like &lt;tt&gt;llapi_hsm_copytool_register()&lt;/tt&gt;?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="468689" author="adilger" created="Sun, 24 Aug 2025 01:20:34 +0000">&lt;p&gt;Currently the "lctl changelog_register/deregister" only run on the MDS. This used to be a limited access request because there is overhead on the MDS when a Changelog user is registered, and it could cause the MDT to run out of space. However, with automatic Changelog garbage collection this should be less of an issue and we might be ok to do this in the future. &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
