&lt;p&gt;I have added a new RPC MDS_CHANGELOG_GET_USER_INFO in &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19296" title="changelog processing should use per-user state" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-19296"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-19296&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; to get changelog user information from MDT to client for changelog filtering. Next, I will improve these APIs with new RPCs, then they will work on client.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
